t be satisfied by $u(x)?$" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388522 1113 #uuid "e225d14b-6814-51a9-af43-900d2917ad01" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388522 1145 "We're given that\n\n$$\n{y}_{2}(x)=u(x){y}_{1}(x)=u{x}^{3}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating ${y}_{2}=u{x}^{3}$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{2}^{′} & ={u}^{′}{x}^{3}+3u{x}^{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}^{″} & ={u}^{″}{x}^{3}+6{u}^{′}{x}^{2}+6ux.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}({u}^{″}{x}^{3}+6{u}^{′}{x}^{2}+6ux)-6u{x}^{3} & =0 \\\\ {u}^{″}{x}^{5}+6{u}^{′}{x}^{4}+6u{x}^{3}-6u{x}^{3} & =0 \\\\ {u}^{″}{x}^{5}+6{u}^{′}{x}^{4} & =0 \\\\ {x}^{4}({u}^{″}x+6{u}^{′}) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince ${x}^{4}\\ne 0$ for $x>0,$ we must have\n\n$$\nx{u}^{″}+6{u}^{′}=0.\n$$" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388524 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388525 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388526 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388527 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388528 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1041 "selection" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388524 13194139536198 true] [17592186388523 1110 #uuid "24b524d8-8458-5dd4-aa56-df61559fe28d" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388524 1034 "x{u}^{″}+6{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388524 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388524 1111 #uuid "609147b4-d37b-5941-aeaf-b564440f1641" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388525 1034 "{u}^{″}+6{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388525 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388525 1111 #uuid "2d7b656e-38e4-50b4-ba6b-a3d0673f1bda" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388526 1034 "x{u}^{″}+3{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388526 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592