e] [17592186388530 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388535 13194139536198 true] [17592186388530 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536198 true] [17592186388530 1041 "selection" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388530 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388532 13194139536198 true] [17592186388530 1110 #uuid "319d98fa-4154-59cf-a093-87baae3d32c2" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388531 1034 "{u}^{″}-{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388531 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388531 1111 #uuid "44c6b3e9-b294-59c7-ba56-175d7c1bd6db" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388532 1034 "{u}^{″}+5{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388532 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388532 1111 #uuid "168b8500-96b4-502b-9131-120eb713112c" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388533 1034 "2{u}^{″}+{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388533 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388533 1111 #uuid "a31c0423-1518-5b70-bfe4-964bfc0d580c" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388534 1034 "{u}^{″}-{e}^{2t}{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388534 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388534 1111 #uuid "4554976a-f416-57b2-bb88-3603466b47ea" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388535 1034 "{e}^{2t}{u}^{″}+{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388535 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388535 1111 #uuid "bade2d21-9239-5ea7-9492-6137f2233202" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388536 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388537 13194139536198 true] [17592186388536 1089 "q-64993" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388536 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536198 true] [17592186388536 1100 "The function ${y}_{1}(x)={e}^{-4x}$ is a solution to the equation ${y}^{″}+8{y}^{′}+16y=0.$ If ${y}_{2}=u(x){y}_{1}(x)$ is a second solution of the equation, then which of the following equations must be satisfied by $u(x)?$" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388536 1113 #uuid "e3f94cd0-0f26-5504-b218-e3f08dc30463" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388536 1145 "We're given that\n\n$$\n{y}_{2}(x)=u(x){y}_{1}(x)=u{e}^{-4x}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating ${y}_{2}=u{e}^{-4x}$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{2}^{′} & ={u}^{′}{e}^{-4x}-4u{e}^{-4x} \\\\ {y}_{2}^{″} & ={u}^{″}{e}^{-4x}-8{u}^{′}{e}^{-4x}+16u{e}^{-4x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({u}^{″}{e}^{-4x}-8{u}^{′}{e}^{-4x}+16u{e}^{-4x})+8({u}^{′}{e}^{-4x}-4u{e}^{-4x})+16u{e}^{-4x} & =0 \\\\ {u}^{″}{e}^{-4x} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince ${e}^{-4x}\\ne 0$ for all $x,$ we must have\n\n$$\n{u}^{″}=0.\n$$" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388538 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388539 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388540 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388541 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388542 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1041 "selection" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388540 13194139536198 true] [17592186388537 1110 #uuid "3b50acc6-7f2b-56d7-a93e-b953b5586d1e" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388538 1034 "{u}^{″}-16{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388538 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388538 1111 #uuid "c1113c41-1136-5bf9-a861-a388bdc07556" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388539 1034 "{u}^{″}+8{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388539 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388539 1111 #uuid "cf54638f-8d75-5357-92c8-fc61691dc0c8" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388540 1034 "{u}^{″}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388540 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388540 1111 #uuid "31558e27-fbf9-545d-a348-27349d2a7c64" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388541 1034 "{u}^{″}+2{u}^{′}=0" 13194139536198 true] [17592186388541 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536198 true] [17592186388541 